format 1
adapter chat 1
npc: npc-hal

node chat-hal-greeting
kind: greeting
pose: greet
title: Chat

    Ah. Hello.

    I was in the middle of weighing a rock, but it will keep. Rocks are good at that.

    I can do four things. One: tell you what is next. Two: remind you of something. Three: ask you a question. Four: tell you about a rock.

    Or five. Nothing. Nothing is underrated.

reply: one, please -> chat-hal-next
reply: two, please -> chat-hal-remind
reply: three, please -> chat-hal-quiz
reply: four, please -> chat-hal-rocks
reply: five -> chat-hal-nothing
reply: goodbye, Hal -> chat-hal-bye

